sequenceDiagram
    actor VREOps as VRE operator
    box
    participant Cron as image-puller-sync<br>(CronJob)
    participant EnvService as environment-service<br>(Deployment)
    participant Puller as image-puller<br>(Daemonset)
    end
    participant Cat as Catalogue-service
    participant k8s as K8s API
    participant GHCR as OCI registry (ghcr.io)
    VREOps -->> Cat: Configure environments `pre_pull` field
    Cron ->> EnvService: POST /image-puller/sync
    EnvService ->> Cat: GET /binder-environments/?pre_pull=true
    EnvService ->> k8s: Update image puller daemonset
    k8s -->> Puller: updates
    GHCR ->> Puller: pull images
